{"name":"Bavarian Cream","hex":"#fff9dd","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bavarian","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A type of custard-like food, made with fruit."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bavarian"},{"term":"cream","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The butterfat or milkfat part of milk which rises to the top; this part when separated from the remainder.","The liquid separated from milk, possibly with certain other milk products added, and with at least eighteen percent of it milkfat."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Cream-coloured; having a yellowish white colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cream"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bavarian cream","blocks":[{"text":"Bavarian cream, crème bavaroise or simply bavarois is a French dessert consisting of an egg-based cooked custard and gelatin or isinglass, into which whipped cream is folded. The mixture sets up in a cold mold and is unmolded for serving. Earlier versions, sometimes called fromage bavarois, did not include eggs or any actual cheese. One recipe using isinglass also calls for crumbled amaretto cookies, chocolate and other flavorings. One contemporary French recipe for \"bavarois\" is a savory preparation with a neufchâtel-type cheese and leeks, and is not a sweet dessert."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Bavarian_cream%2C_strawberries%2C_caramel_sauce%2C_spoon.jpg/330px-Bavarian_cream%2C_strawberries%2C_caramel_sauce%2C_spoon.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bavarian_cream","wikidata":"Q623550"},{"title":"Cream","blocks":[{"text":"Cream is a dairy product composed of the higher-fat layer skimmed from the top of milk before homogenization. The butterfat, which is less dense, rises to the top and is skimmed off, resulting in gravity cream. The industrial production of cream instead uses centrifugal separators to make separator cream. Cream is often sold in grades defined by their butterfat content. It contains high levels of saturated fat, in ascending proportion from light cream to heavy cream."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/01_Mmm..._Apple_Crisp_with_Whipped_Cream.jpg/330px-01_Mmm..._Apple_Crisp_with_Whipped_Cream.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream","wikidata":"Q13228"},{"title":"Cream (colour)","blocks":[{"text":"Cream is the color of the cream produced by cattle grazing on natural pasture with plants rich in yellow carotenoid pigments, some of which are incorporated into the fresh milk. This gives a yellow tone to otherwise-white milk at higher fat concentrations. Cream is the pastel colour of yellow, much as pink is to red. By mixing yellow and white, cream can be produced."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Milk_heavy_cream_B.jpg/330px-Milk_heavy_cream_B.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream_(colour)","wikidata":"Q2730433"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Hur_Mon_Bavarian_Cream_Recipe.jpg/500px-Hur_Mon_Bavarian_Cream_Recipe.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Hur_Mon_Bavarian_Cream_Recipe.jpg/1280px-Hur_Mon_Bavarian_Cream_Recipe.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Hur_Mon_Bavarian_Cream_Recipe.jpg/500px-Hur_Mon_Bavarian_Cream_Recipe.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A Bavarian Cream recipe from 1929, which did not require cooking or eggs.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHur_Mon_Bavarian_Cream_Recipe.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Bayerische_Creme.JPG/250px-Bayerische_Creme.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Bayerische_Creme.JPG/500px-Bayerische_Creme.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Bayerische_Creme.JPG/250px-Bayerische_Creme.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABayerische_Creme.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Bavarian_cream_with_strawberries.jpg/250px-Bavarian_cream_with_strawberries.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Bavarian_cream_with_strawberries.jpg/500px-Bavarian_cream_with_strawberries.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Bavarian_cream_with_strawberries.jpg/250px-Bavarian_cream_with_strawberries.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABavarian_cream_with_strawberries.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Bavarian_Cr%C3%A8me_Bismark_-_Top_Pot_Doughnuts_-_27_November_2022.jpg/250px-Bavarian_Cr%C3%A8me_Bismark_-_Top_Pot_Doughnuts_-_27_November_2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Bavarian_Cr%C3%A8me_Bismark_-_Top_Pot_Doughnuts_-_27_November_2022.jpg/500px-Bavarian_Cr%C3%A8me_Bismark_-_Top_Pot_Doughnuts_-_27_November_2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Bavarian_Cr%C3%A8m